extends layouts/layout.pug

block content

    section.page-hero
        .public-container
            span.eyebrow
                | How It Works
            h1
                | A structured process from request to report.
            p
                | NDUKA takes you through a defined investigation process,
                | from submitting your request to receiving the outcome of
                | the investigation.

    section.process-section
        .public-container
            .process-grid

                article.process-step
                    span.step-number
                        | 01
                    h3
                        | Submit an Investigation Request
                    p
                        | Provide the applicant and subject information,
                        | explain the purpose of the request, select one or
                        | more investigation services, and provide the
                        | particulars required for those services. You do
                        | not need to create an account before submitting
                        | your request.

                article.process-step
                    span.step-number
                        | 02
                    h3
                        | Receive Your Request Reference
                    p
                        | After submission, NDUKA provides a request
                        | reference that can be used to check the status of
                        | your investigation request through the public
                        | Check Status service.

                article.process-step
                    span.step-number
                        | 03
                    h3
                        | Request Review
                    p
                        | NDUKA reviews the submitted request and the
                        | investigation services requested. The request may
                        | be accepted or rejected. Where a request is
                        | rejected, the applicable rejection reason is
                        | recorded and made available through the request
                        | status process.

                article.process-step
                    span.step-number
                        | 04
                    h3
                        | Acceptance & Payment Preparation
                    p
                        | When a request is accepted, NDUKA prepares the
                        | requested investigation services and the applicable
                        | charges. The visitor is notified when the request
                        | reaches the payment-ready stage.

                article.process-step
                    span.step-number
                        | 05
                    h3
                        | Payment Confirmation
                    p
                        | The current NDUKA payment workflow records and
                        | processes payment intent and confirmation within
                        | NDUKA. It is not presented here as a live external
                        | payment gateway. Once payment is successfully
                        | confirmed, the accepted request can proceed into
                        | the investigation workflow.

                article.process-step
                    span.step-number
                        | 06
                    h3
                        | Investigation & Report
                    p
                        | NDUKA carries out the requested investigation
                        | services through its investigation workflow.
                        | Progress is managed through the case process, and
                        | an approved report can be made available to the
                        | authorised client account where applicable.

    section.intro-section
        .public-container
            .feature-grid

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Stay informed
                    p
                        | Important request updates may be communicated
                        | using the email address and phone details supplied
                        | with your request, including acceptance, rejection,
                        | payment readiness, and relevant account activation
                        | information where a client account is created.

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Check your status
                    p
                        | Your request reference allows you to return to
                        | NDUKA and check the current status of your
                        | investigation request without needing access to
                        | the staff investigation workspace.

                article.feature-card
                    h3
                        | Structured investigation
                    p
                        | Each accepted request is connected to the
                        | appropriate client, case, and investigation
                        | services so that the work can be managed through
                        | a defined operational process.

    section.cta-section
        .public-container
            .cta-content
                div
                    span.eyebrow
                        | Get Started
                    h2
                        | Ready to submit an investigation request?
                    p
                        | Start by providing the information required for
                        | NDUKA to review your request.
                div
                    a.btn.btn-primary(
                        href="/start-investigation"
                    )
                        | Start an Investigation
                    a.btn.btn-secondary(
                        href="/investigation-request-status"
                    )
                        | Check Status
